{
  "name": "GitHub AI Coding Agent - Feature to PR",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "feature_ticket",
              "name": "feature_ticket",
              "value": "={{ $json.feature_ticket || 'Add a new user authentication feature with JWT tokens' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "repo_owner",
              "name": "repo_owner",
              "value": "={{ $json.repo_owner || 'your-username' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "repo_name",
              "name": "repo_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.repo_name || 'your-repo' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "base_branch",
              "name": "base_branch",
              "value": "={{ $json.base_branch || 'main' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-8901-bcde-f12345678901",
      "name": "Set Input Parameters",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/{{ $('Set Input Parameters').item.json.repo_owner }}/{{ $('Set Input Parameters').item.json.repo_name }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012",
      "name": "Get Repository Info",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [680, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/{{ $('Set Input Parameters').item.json.repo_owner }}/{{ $('Set Input Parameters').item.json.repo_name }}/git/refs/heads/{{ $('Set Input Parameters').item.json.base_branch }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d4e5f6a7-b8c9-0123-def0-234567890123",
      "name": "Get Base Branch SHA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [900, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Generate branch name from feature ticket\nconst featureTicket = $input.first().json.feature_ticket;\nconst timestamp = Date.now();\nconst branchName = `ai-agent/${featureTicket.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, '-').substring(0, 50)}-${timestamp}`;\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    branch_name: branchName,\n    feature_ticket: featureTicket,\n    repo_owner: $('Set Input Parameters').item.json.repo_owner,\n    repo_name: $('Set Input Parameters').item.json.repo_name,\n    base_sha: $('Get Base Branch SHA').item.json.object.sha,\n    base_branch: $('Set Input Parameters').item.json.base_branch,\n    default_branch: $('Get Repository Info').item.json.default_branch,\n    repo_description: $('Get Repository Info').item.json.description,\n    repo_language: $('Get Repository Info').item.json.language\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "e5f6a7b8-c9d0-1234-ef01-345678901234",
      "name": "Generate Branch Name",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1120, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert software engineer AI assistant tasked with implementing a new feature for a GitHub repository.\n\n## Repository Information:\n- Owner: {{ $json.repo_owner }}\n- Repository: {{ $json.repo_name }}\n- Language: {{ $json.repo_language }}\n- Description: {{ $json.repo_description }}\n- Base Branch: {{ $json.base_branch }}\n\n## Feature Request:\n{{ $json.feature_ticket }}\n\n## Your Task:\nAnalyze the feature request and generate the necessary code changes to implement this feature. You should:\n\n1. **Understand the Context**: Read the feature request carefully and understand what needs to be built.\n\n2. **Plan the Implementation**: Think about:\n   - What files need to be created or modified\n   - What code patterns and best practices to follow\n   - What dependencies might be needed\n   - How to structure the code properly\n\n3. **Generate Code**: Create or modify files with:\n   - Clean, well-documented code\n   - Proper error handling\n   - Following the repository's language conventions\n   - Include necessary tests if applicable\n\n4. **Output Format**: Return your response in the following JSON format:\n```json\n{\n  \"implementation_plan\": \"Brief description of your implementation approach\",\n  \"files\": [\n    {\n      \"path\": \"path/to/file.ext\",\n      \"content\": \"Complete file content here\",\n      \"action\": \"create or update\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"pr_title\": \"Concise PR title\",\n  \"pr_description\": \"Detailed PR description with:\n- What was implemented\n- How to test it\n- Any breaking changes\n- Additional notes\"\n}\n```\n\n**IMPORTANT**: \n- Return ONLY the JSON object, no markdown code blocks or additional text\n- Ensure all code is production-ready\n- Follow best practices for the programming language\n- Include comments in the code to explain complex logic\n- Make sure file paths are correct and follow the repository structure\n\nGenerate the implementation now:",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert software engineering AI that generates high-quality, production-ready code. You follow best practices, write clean and maintainable code, and always structure your responses in valid JSON format."
        }
      },
      "id": "f6a7b8c9-d0e1-2345-f012-456789012345",
      "name": "AI Agent - Code Generator",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [1340, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 8000,
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "01a2b3c4-d5e6-f789-0123-567890123456",
      "name": "Anthropic Chat Model - Claude",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [1340, 500],
      "credentials": {
        "anthropicApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_ANTHROPIC_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Anthropic API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "parsed_response",
              "name": "parsed_response",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.output || $json.text || '{}') }}",
              "type": "object"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "12b3c4d5-e6f7-8901-2345-678901234567",
      "name": "Parse AI Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1560, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/{{ $('Generate Branch Name').item.json.repo_owner }}/{{ $('Generate Branch Name').item.json.repo_name }}/git/refs",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "value": "=refs/heads/{{ $('Generate Branch Name').item.json.branch_name }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "sha",
              "value": "={{ $('Generate Branch Name').item.json.base_sha }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "23c4d5e6-f7a8-9012-3456-789012345678",
      "name": "Create New Branch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [1780, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Split the parsed response into individual file items for processing\nconst parsedResponse = $input.first().json.parsed_response;\nconst files = parsedResponse.files || [];\nconst branchData = $('Generate Branch Name').item.json;\n\nconst items = files.map(file => ({\n  json: {\n    file_path: file.path,\n    file_content: file.content,\n    file_action: file.action,\n    branch_name: branchData.branch_name,\n    repo_owner: branchData.repo_owner,\n    repo_name: branchData.repo_name,\n    pr_title: parsedResponse.pr_title,\n    pr_description: parsedResponse.pr_description,\n    implementation_plan: parsedResponse.implementation_plan,\n    base_branch: branchData.base_branch\n  }\n}));\n\nreturn items;"
      },
      "id": "34d5e6f7-a8b9-0123-4567-890123456789",
      "name": "Split Files for Commit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [2000, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/{{ $json.repo_owner }}/{{ $json.repo_name }}/contents/{{ $json.file_path }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "=AI Agent: {{ $json.file_action }} {{ $json.file_path }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "content",
              "value": "={{ Buffer.from($json.file_content).toString('base64') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "branch",
              "value": "={{ $json.branch_name }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "45e6f7a8-b9c0-1234-5678-901234567890",
      "name": "Commit File to Branch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [2220, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combineBy": "combineAll",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "56f7a8b9-c0d1-2345-6789-012345678901",
      "name": "Aggregate Commits",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2440, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.github.com/repos/{{ $json.repo_owner }}/{{ $json.repo_name }}/pulls",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.pr_title }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "body",
              "value": "={{ $json.pr_description }}\n\n---\n\n🤖 **This PR was automatically generated by an AI Agent**\n\n**Implementation Plan:**\n{{ $json.implementation_plan }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "head",
              "value": "={{ $json.branch_name }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "base",
              "value": "={{ $json.base_branch }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "67a8b9c0-d1e2-3456-7890-123456789012",
      "name": "Create Pull Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4,
      "position": [2660, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "pr_url",
              "name": "pr_url",
              "value": "={{ $json.html_url }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "pr_number",
              "name": "pr_number",
              "value": "={{ $json.number }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "branch_name",
              "name": "branch_name",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Files for Commit').first().json.branch_name }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "message",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "=✅ Successfully created PR #{{ $json.number }}: {{ $json.html_url }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "78b9c0d1-e2f3-4567-8901-234567890123",
      "name": "Format Success Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [2880, 300]
    }
  ],
